 ing something for collectors of all ages and interests.\n\nBrowse a wide s
 election of sports cards\, autographs\, memorabilia\, jerseys\, supplies\
 , vintage and modern collectibles\, singles\, sealed boxes\, Pokémon card
 s\, One Piece cards\, and much more. Whether you're hunting for a rare gra
 il\, building your collection\, or just getting started in the hobby\, you
 'll find plenty to explore.\n\nWe're actively looking to buy\, sell\, and
  trade\, so bring your collection\, duplicates\, or items you've been thin
 king about selling. Our team will be available throughout the fair to talk
  cards\, collectibles\, and the hobby we all love.\n\n📅 June 18–21\,
  2026 🕚 Petaluma Fair Hours: 11:00 AM – 11:00 PM Daily 📍 Petalum
 a Fairgrounds 175 Fairgrounds Drive Petaluma\, CA\n\nFeaturing:\n\nSports 
 Cards\n\nAutographs\n\nMemorabilia\n\nJerseys\n\nPokémon Cards\n\nOne Pie
 ce Cards\n\nVintage & Modern Collectibles\n\nSingles & Sealed Products\n\n
 Hobby Supplies\n\nBuy • Sell • Trade\n\nStop by our booth\, meet fello
