DESCRIPTION:Families with children 12 and under are invited to enjoy a fun
  and educational day exploring the wonders of our solar system at the Robe
 rt Ferguson Observatory. This special program features hands-on activities
 \, interactive learning\, and outdoor adventures designed to spark curiosi
 ty about the planets\, the Sun\, and our cosmic neighborhood. Advance tick
 ets are required\, and attendance is limited to ensure a great experience 
 for all guests. Children must be accompanied by an adult chaperone. Visito
 rs are encouraged to bring sun protection and water\, as part of the progr
 am takes place outdoors. Families may also enjoy the nearby picnic area be
 fore activities begin. It's a memorable day of discovery\, learning\, and 
 celestial fun for young explorers.
LOCATION:Robert Ferguson Observatory
