DESCRIPTION:TOUR \\+ TASTE \\+ LEARNand explore our local agriculture Join
  us for the weekend as 20\\+ farms\, ranches\, producers and purveyors wel
 come you to experience our local agriCULTURE first hand\, out on the trail
 . TICKETS ARE FREE!!All guests must register to attend - registration is f
 ree & easy WHAT IS OPEN FARM DAYS WEEKEND?Open Farm Days Weekend is an up-
 close chance to experience and learn about our local agriculture through f
 arm visits\, tours\, demonstrations\, tastings\, workshops and more – at
  various farms across the SLO County Farm Trail.  This family-friendly wee
 kend is designed to be a “choose your own adventure” tour of the SLO C
 ounty Farm Trail. Ticket holders are invited to review each participating 
 farm's happenings and plan which farms they would like to visit\, setting 
 their own itinerary and pace to explore the trail on Open Farm Days Weeken
 d.  REGISTER FOR YOUR FREE TICKETSRegistration is required We are excited 
 to announce that our 6th annual Open Farm Days Weekend is FREE to attend! 
 To attend this year's Open Farm Days Weekend you must register - registrat
 ion is free & easy. Once you have registered please make sure to check out
  each farm's activites for the weekend. Some farm's activities may require
  a fee and/or additional RSVP made directly with that farm. PLAN YOUR WEEK
 ENDOpen Farm Days Weekend is a "create your own itinerary" tour of the Far
 m Trail. It is best to make sure to pre-plan your stops and route before y
 ou start the weekend. Things to note when planning your own Open Farm Days
  itinerary:- Each participating farm has their own activities and experien
 ces planned- Hours vary by location\, some may be open just one day- Some 
 farm's activities may require a fee and/or additional RSVP made directly w
 ith that farm Start here: Check out our QUICK OVERVIEW PLANNING GUIDE for 
 a quick rundown of who is doing what\, when\, and where to kick off your p
 lanning. Then check out our interactive TRAIL MAP: you can save farms to y
 our favorites and create your own itinerary that you can export out into G
 oogle Maps for handy navigation. Open Farm Days Weekend is presented by FA
 RMstead ED\, a 501\\(c\\)5 nonprofit organization helping to broaden aware
 ness of local family farms in our community and showcase the sustainable m
 ethods used to produce the food and products we rely on every day.  FARMst
 ead ED | SLO County Farm Trail's Open Farm Days Weekend is fiscally-sponso
 red by Ecologistics\, a 501\\(c\\)\\(3\\) in San Luis Obispo\, California 
 and sponsored in part by CA Open Farm Passport
URL:https://www.my805tix.com/e/open-farm-days-2026/tickets
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
