 arcus is known for his razor-sharp wit and his “double life” as a stru
 ctural engineer by day and stand-up killer by night. He’s lit up stages 
 at the San Francisco Punchline\, Cobb’s Comedy Club\, SF Sketchfest\, an
 d Comedy Central’s Clusterfest\, and has performed everywhere from New Y
 ork to Denver. His comedy blends clever social commentary with personal st
 ories—often diving into life as a gay man\, mental health\, sobriety\, a
 nd the absurdities of everyday life.\n\nPresented in partnership with Come
 dy IRL\, this SoCo Pride edition of Tokes & Jokes brings together inclusiv
 e\, unapologetic comedy with the signature Mercy Lounge experience\, an in
 clusive welcoming space to laugh loud and be yourself. Come early\, spark 
 up\, and settle in for a night of unforgettable laughs and community vibes
 .\n\nSponsored By: ABX and Sonoma County Pride.\n\nTastings by: Himalaya V
 apor\, ABX\n\nDate & Time\n\nDate: Friday\, June 16\, 2026\n\nTime: 6:00 P
 M - 10:00 PM\n\nDJ: 6:00 PM - 8:00 PM\n\nShow Starts at: 8:00 PM\n\nTicket
