 alue\\) included. Limited seating.\n\n⭐ $75 — Preferred Bucket \\+ Pre
 mium Bag \\(Most Popular\\) The crowd favorite ⭐ Guaranteed bucket seat 
 \\+ shared table access\, plus upgraded goodie bag \\($50 value\\) include
 d. Limited seating. \n\n💎 $100 — Preferred Bucket \\+ VIP Bag Go big 
 tonight 💎 Guaranteed bucket seat \\+ shared table access\, plus loaded 
 goodie bag \\($100 value\\) included. Limited seating. \n\n🔥 $175 — 
 Couch Crew Pass \\(3 Guests \\+ VIP Bag\\) Bring your crew 🔥 Includes a
 dmission for 3 guests\, reserved couch seating with a dedicated table\, pl
 us a premium bag \\($150 value\\) included. Only 11 couches.\n\n👑 $200 
 — VIP Flex Pass \\+ Elite Bag \\(Limited\\) Top-tier perks 👑 Priority
  seating plus elite goodie bag \\($250 value\\) included. Very limited.\n\
 n21\\+ Only | DCC \\# C12-0000420-LIC\n\nEvent Terms & Conditions\n\nThis 
 event is 21\\+ only. Valid government-issued ID is required for entry. By 
 attending this event at the Mercy Wellness Lounge\, you acknowledge that p
 hotography and video recording may take place. Images and footage may be u
 sed by Mercy Wellness for marketing and promotional purposes across variou
 s channels\, without compensation. Tickets are non-refundable unless other
 wise stated. Event details\, timing\, or programming are subject to change
 .\n\nCannabis consumption is limited to designated areas and must comply w
 ith all applicable local and state regulations. Please consume responsibly
 .\n\nBy entering the venue\, you agree to comply with all house rules and 
