BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:1TRIBE ❤️ Juneteenth Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260619T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260619T220000
UID:260514YX8rB-0Xq0iL_OY2lEB4cA
DESCRIPTION:1TRIBE Afrobeats • Amapiano • Reggae • Dancehall Friday 
 June 19th\, 10 PM This is a dance party take-over of Barrel Proof Lounge S
 tep into 1TRIBE\, a night where African rhythm\, Caribbean power\, and glo
 bal club culture meet under one roof. Afrobeats rolls into Amapiano. Regga
 e grooves slide into Dancehall energy. The sound is warm\, heavy\, and ful
 l of movement. The vibe is unity through rhythm. This is not just another 
 party in the North Bay. It is a cultural gathering built on sound\, commun
 ity\, and shared pulse. When the bass hits\, the night begins. Meet the DJ
 s DJ KONNEX Voted NorBays 2025 Best Live DJ\, Konnex is a rhythm architect
  with a deep love for Afro diasporic sounds and modern global club energy.
  His sets are known for fluid storytelling\, seamless transitions\, and a 
 sense of journey that keeps the room moving. He pulls from deep crates and
  a wide range of genres\, creating an atmosphere that feels both intention
 al and electric. DJ KOBIE International selector and member of the global 
 collective Ashanti Hi Fi\, Kobie represents the spirit of worldwide sound 
 system culture. His sets carry the pulse of Africa\, the Caribbean\, and t
 he global underground. Heavy bass\, ancestral drums\, and musical intuitio
 n shape every moment he plays. Kobie does more than select tracks. He chan
 nels a feeling that connects dancers across borders. Together\, Konnex and
  Kobie form 1Tribe. Two selectors\, one intention. A night built on rhythm
 \, unity\, and the shared heartbeat of the dancefloor. The tribe is gather
 ing. The night is calling. Juneteenth is an annual observance on June 19 t
 o remember when Union soldiers enforced the Emancipation Proclamation and 
 freed all remaining slaves in Texas on June 19\, 1865. This day is an oppo
 rtunity for people to celebrate freedom and equal rights in the United Sta
 tes.
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/935572779480718/?acontext=%7B%22event_
 action_history%22%3A[%7B%22mechanism%22%3A%22lov_feed%22%2C%22surface%22%3
 A%22bookmark%22%7D]%2C%22ref_notif_type%22%3Anull%7D
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
