BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Juneteenth Lobster Boil at Charles Krug Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260619T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260619T210000
UID:260617llN3x-ATU0KwQIc9Eluz3A
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Juneteenth at Charles Krug Winery with a festive sum
 mer lobster boil in Napa Valley’s oldest winery. Set in the historic Pri
 vate Barrel Room\, this lively\, family-style gathering honors heritage\, 
 freedom\, and community through great food and wine.    Guests will enjoy 
 a classic coastal boil featuring Maine lobster\, jumbo shrimp\, Louisiana 
 hot links\, corn\, potatoes\, artichokes\, and fresh bread—served tradit
 ionally right on the table for a hands-on dining experience.    The evenin
 g includes perfectly paired pours of Charles Krug Chenin Blanc and Merlot\
 , along with insights from Mondavi family members on the winery’s legacy
  and future.    With special pricing on wines and an unforgettable setting
 \, this event offers a unique way to celebrate Juneteenth in the heart of 
 Napa Valley.
LOCATION:Charles Krug Winery
URL:https://www.napavalley.com/event/juneteenth-lobster-boil-at-charles-kr
 ug-winery/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
