DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T220000
UID:260607ZwUYXhn81UWhtent9aa36w
DESCRIPTION:Turnbull’s Summer Solstice Celebration makes its second-annu
 al return. Enjoy a relaxed\, wine-country-style BBQ with mouthwatering bit
 es that complement every sip of Turnbull’s acclaimed wines. With the go
 lden hour stretching long into the evening\, we’ll raise a glass to the 
