BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Flynn Creek Circus - The Cricket and the Wren
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T150000
UID:260529vLUY9QKykEigWDgrxgnIKw
DESCRIPTION:Flynn Creek Circus Presents ‘The Cricket & the Wren’: a hi
 ghly original\, all-human circus that enchants through breathtaking acroba
 tics and athletically stunning skill. Sponsored by the City of Rohnert Par
 k.\n\nRohnert Park\, CA— June 18 - June 28– This 2026 season\, Flynn C
 reek Circus invites audiences to ‘The Cricket & the Wren’ — memorabl
 e family fun and Artful athleticism under the circus big top.\n\nA merchan
 t’s daughter sets out to find the castle where the horizon meets the sea
 . In order to  break the spell of the Frog Prince\, she must brave a harr
 owing journey filled with wonder.\n\nAlong the adventure\, she encounters 
 Jack and the Beanstalk’s sassy cow\, an out of pocket Pirate and the sec
 ret sacrifice of the cricket and the wren. \n\nFeaturing aerialists\, jug
 glers\, knife throwers\, and laugh out loud comedy\, this circus blends cl
 assic storybook archetypes with imaginative new heroes. The Cricket and th
 e Wren will surprise\, dazzle and delight all ages. \n\nIn addition to th
 e family friendly showings\,  and the interactive children's camp program
  held under the circus big top\,  Flynn Creek Circus also presents the wi
 ldly popular 'Adults Only Show' boasting outrageous acts\, dark comedy\, a
 nd an infamous party atmosphere. Check the website for select adults only 
 showtimes as well as special discount nights.\n\nSpectators for all showin
 gs are invited to the tent to experience the magic up to 30 minutes before
  each show. The event will offer beer\, wine\, and light concession for pu
 rchase and include a 15 minute intermission during the two hour show.\n\nL
 imited free parking is available at 500 City Center Drive. Patrons should 
 then cross the street in the pedestrian crossing at the Rohnert Park Expre
 ssway and State Farm Drive traffic signal.\n\nTickets for Flynn Creek Circ
 us are now available for purchase online at flynncreekcircus.com. Individu
 al ticket prices start at $27 or\, for table reservations\, options start 
 at $98 for two attendees. \n\nFind showtimes and more details on the camp
  programs for ages 5-8 and 7-15 at flynncreekcircus.com\n\nEarly booking i
 s encouraged for this highly anticipated event. \n\nLocation: SE corner l
 ot at Rohnert Park Expressway and State Farm Dr. Rohnert Park\, CA 94928 U
 nder the circus big top\n\nFor more information\, press inquiries\, or int
 erview requests\, please contact Stella Perry at marketing@flynncreekcircu
 s.com. High-resolution images and media resources are also available upon 
 request\n\nAbout Flynn Creek Circus:Flynn Creek Circus is an original\, mo
 dern circus company touring across the Pacific Northwest\, delighting audi
 ences with world-class acrobatics\, storytelling\, and comedy. Known for i
 ts innovative productions and intimate tent shows\, the company redefines 
 the traditional circus experience
LOCATION:Under the circus big top
URL:https://flynncreekcircus.ticketspice.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
