BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Alchemy of Summer Solstice: A Ritual of Release and Embodiment
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260620T160000
UID:2605190oCT9-kVmUmaTfiHF90W7Q
DESCRIPTION:with Erin Selover and Susan Harper\n\nThis daylong will weave 
 Insight Meditation with the embodied practice of Continuum. One of the cor
 e teachings of the Buddha is that we suffer when we hold on to fixed views
  and identities. Continuum is a somatic practice that uses breath\, sound\
 , and fluid movement to dissolve fixed patterns and awaken the body’s in
 nate\, fluid intelligence. Together\, we will align with the elements—fi
 re\, earth\, water\, air\, and space—in our bodies\; expanding our inher
 ent belonging to the cycles of the earth\, sun\, moon\, and cosmos.  With
 in the auspiciousness of Summer Solstice\, we will ritually release what i
 s no longer serving and align with our deepest motivation to respond with 
 embodied clarity and compassion to our aching world. \n\nWe will practice
  seated\, walking\, lying down in stillness and movement meditations both 
 indoors and outdoors. Please bring a lunch\, journal\, and clothing layers
 .
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/the-alchemy-of-summer-
 solstice-a-ritual-of-release-and-embodiment-es1d26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
