  is a great place to pick up produce\, flowers\, and eggs harvested from o
 ur 6.1 acre sustainable garden. We will be selling products such as fresh 
 produce\, eggs from free-range chickens\, honey\, and olive oil. The marke
 t now accepts credit cards. Remember to bring your reusable shopping bag! 
 \n\nTo stay updated on our events\, sign up for our newsletter at: sonomae
 cologycenter.org/newsletters-sign-up
