DESCRIPTION:Come join us for our Summer Garden Party on The Terrace and Th
 e Green! Kick off the season in Rodney Strong's backyard with family and f
 riends at this relaxed\, festive\, and family-friendly event. Enjoy live D
 J entertainment\, face painting for all ages and classic lawn games. Rodne
 y Strong wines will be available by the glass and bottle\, along with deli
 cious savory fare from local food trucks. Whether you're a wine lover or j
 ust looking for a fun afternoon out\, this garden party is sure to be a hi
 ghlight of your summer! Your ticket includes - A complimentary glass of wi
 ne \\(21\\+ only\\) - Gourmet cheese & charcuterie - Dessert bites
LOCATION:Rodney Strong Vineyards
