SUMMARY:Queer Awareness in Uncertain Times: Cultivating a Spiritual Center
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260621T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260621T130000
UID:260519YgZc5h6qeEy_AEQ852jKOg
DESCRIPTION:with Carol Cano\, Kimber Simpkins-Nuccio and Rebekah Eppley\n\
 nThis gathering invites LGBTQ+ community and allies into shared space of p
 resence\, care\, and belonging.\n\nIn times of uncertainty\, queer awarene
 ss becomes a sacred orientation that is fluid\, intuitive\, and embodied i
 n truth. It honors the fullness of lived experience while opening pathways
  toward resilience and collective liberation. Together\, we cultivate a sp
 iritual center grounded in mindfulness\, compassion\, and relational pract
 ice.\n\nThrough meditation\, reflection\, and community connection\, we ge
 ntly steady the heart and soften the body. We listen deeply to ourselves\,
  to one another\, and to the living nature reflects and holds us. Througho
 ut this half-day\, we’ll remember belonging as a living experience that 
 is held by connection\, sustained through community\, and expressed throug
 h love\, dignity\, and shared liberation.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/queer-awareness-in-unc
 ertain-times-cultivating-a-spiritual-center-cc2h26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
