DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260621T150000
UID:2606187C6wc8-ruU2BrI07ZI6QIw
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy an all-ages performance that celebrates the legacy and d
 iversity of composers in the United States. A string quartet will perform 
 works from composers ranging from historical \\(Charles Ives\, Florence Pr
 ice\\) to contemporary \\(Gabriela Lena Frank\\) and concluding with a sin
 g-along of America the Beautiful. Presented by Santa Rosa Symphony and Son
 oma County Library with special guest speakers.
