 talents on the San Francisco/Bay Area music scene. Her early classical tra
 ining is reflected in her powerful and versatile vocal style that creates 
 an emotional authenticity that consistently cuts deep. Her music straddles
  soul\, blues\, funk and New Orleans R&B\, always with a nod to her Chican
 a heritage.  Blues Defenders hosts a weekly concert with headliners and sw
 ing dancing. Followed by Pro Jam. Doors open at 5pm Show Starts at 6pm. Ti
 ckets $15 online. $18 at door. $12 for members. Hosted by The Blues Defend
