  day of the year\, **honor Community Health Champions**\, and raise criti
 cal funds that sustain equitable\, high-quality healthcare for patients an
 d families across Marin County.\n\nGuests will enjoy an evening of food\, 
 drink\, music\, and connection as we celebrate two decades of impact\, par
 tnership\, and the collective power of community.\n\n**Event Details**\n\n
 Date: June 25\, 2026\n\nTime: 5:00 p.m. - 7:30 p.m.\n\n**Location:** Bill
  & Adele Jonas Center\n\n1800 Ignacio Blvd Building 19\, \n\nNovato\, CA 
