 hairs\, sold in units of 2 only. Price is per seat\, not per table\, and i
 ncludes access to the Club Lounge with a cash bar and A/C. The Gold & Silv
 er Sections have reserved seating\, while the Bronze Lawn Section is stand
 ing room only\; blankets are okay\, but no chairs are allowed. All prices 
 are per person\, and each patron requires a ticket for entry. Ages 8\\+ on
 ly\, no infants. Food & drinks are available for purchase. All tickets are
  pre-purchased and will be available in your Ticketmaster account to be sc
 anned for entry. Bathrooms are available. No corkage or outside food/drink
 \, no professional cameras\, no smoking\, and service animals only. Visit 
