BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Myofascial Release Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260627T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260627T133000
UID:260615ttmKk7iqK0qRetSNP-yzWQ
DESCRIPTION:Release tension. Restore movement. Reconnect to your body.\n\n
 Are you feeling tight\, stressed\, sore\, or restricted in your movement? 
 You don't want to miss this opportunity!\n\nThe workshop begins with an in
 formative introduction to the fascia system and the important role it play
 s in mobility\, posture\, recovery\, and overall body function. From there
 \, you’ll be guided through a restorative myofascial release experience 
 focused on reducing tension\, improving movement\, and promoting recovery.
 \n\nUsing massage balls\, foam rollers\, and targeted stretching technique
 s\, we’ll explore areas of common tightness and restriction throughout t
 he body.\n\nThis workshop is suitable for all levels and is a great opport
 unity to:\n\n• Release built-up stress and tension\n\n• Improve flexib
 ility and mobility\n\n• Support muscle recovery\n\n• Feel refreshed\, 
 restored\, and more connected to your body\n\nSpace is limited — reserve
  your spot today! Don't miss the opportunity to treat yourself!
LOCATION:YogaSix Santa Rosa
URL:https://www.yogasix.com/location/santa-rosa
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
