BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Collector's Cellar at The Lodge at Dawn Ranch with Dancing Sonoma
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260627T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260627T200000
UID:260611TD3yKwE37UuPPquaP__Awg
DESCRIPTION:This summer\, The Lodge at Dawn Ranch is elevating the wine di
 nner beyond pairings and pours with the launch of Collector's Cellar\, an 
 ongoing series offering guests access to rare bottles\, acclaimed producer
 s\, historic wineries and collaborations typically reserved for collectors
  and wine industry insiders. \n\nOn June 27 from 5-8pm\, guests can exper
 ience an evening with Dancing Sonoma\, a reimagined Sonoma vineyard by a m
 other-daughter duo taking a modern\, artisanal\, hands-on approach to wine
 making that prioritizes texture\, balance\, and individuality over convent
 ion. Guests can enjoy a seasonal multi-course menu highlighting fresh seaf
 ood and peak-season produce\, with each course thoughtfully paired with a 
 selection of the winery’s collection of zinfandels. The series is design
 ed to deepen guests’ connection to the stories\, philosophies\, and craf
 tsmanship behind the glass\, bringing together pioneering winemakers and s
 ingular wines that reflect a distinct sense of place and identity. The tas
 ting menu includes: \n\nOyster\, Scallop Tostada\, and Dadinho de Tapioca
  paired with Bounce \\(zinfandel\, sparkling rose\, 2024\\)\n\nAsparagus p
 aired with Dancing Rose \\(zinfandel\, 2025\\)\n\nFava and Morels paired w
 ith Fresh Take \\(zinfandel\, 2024\\) \n\nSnake River Farm Picanha with c
 himichurri paired with Duo \\(zinfandel\, 2024\\)\n\nPeach dessert paired 
 with Old Vine \\(zinfandel\, 2023\\)
LOCATION:The Lodge at Dawn Ranch
URL:https://lodgeatdawnranch.com/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
