UID:260613hO_12Q0g2kOcymHC72_3Zg
DESCRIPTION:David Estes\, Prajna Vieira and friends return to OCA for a ma
 gical evening of Kirtan! This event is scheduled to take place in our amph
 itheater \\(outdoor stage\\). Bring a cushion or low-back chair. Tickets a
 vailable online or at the door. Doors open at 6:00 PM. Tickets are $25\, d
 iscount for OCA members. Ananda Rasa \\(the bliss of Divine rapture\\) Kir
 tan is led by vocalist and multi-instrumentalist Mr. David \\(David Estes\
 \)\, who is currently based in the San Francisco Bay Area. Mr. David grew 
 up in India and spent several years completely immersed in the practices o
 f kirtan\, sanskrit text chanting\, meditation\, and service as a full-tim
 e resident in daily ashram life. Ananda Rasa Kirtan is rooted in tradition
 al Sanskrit chants and mantras sung to original Indian raga melody composi
 tions and explores the ecstatic and mystical moods of Bhakti in call and r
 esponse chanting with the audience. Mr. David also owns and runs his harmo
 nium brand and company Ragamala Harmoniums
LOCATION:Occidental Center for the Arts
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/837962889347200/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
