UID:260617FwJzxMMYeUehxm0e5JCWOA
DESCRIPTION:**CASA CENI PRESENTS**\n\n**MAIN ST.**\n\n**\\+ LITTLE DOOR**\
 n\n**HopMonk Sebastopol - The Abbey**\n\n**MOSTLY STANDING | ALL AGES**\n\
 n**ABOUT:** \n\n**Main St.** (headliner)\n\n"Sebastopol's own premier clas
 sic rock tribute band!" \n\n**Little Door** (support)\n\nLittle Door begi
 ns with a simple idea: each person is a portal into deep consciousness\, a
 nd music is one way to open that door. Rooted in psych-folk and cosmic gro
 ove\, her acoustic performances draw on themes of awakening\, motherhood\,
  love\, and the tender\, unspoken corners of the psyche. Unhurried and emb
 odied\, her live sets are the kind you feel as much as hear.
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern
URL:https://wl.eventim.us/event/main-st/694411?afflky=HopMonkSebastopol
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
