BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Joy of Dhamma Practice
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T150000
UID:260519ucu2eXk_wEO0o1wK7MsAnw
DESCRIPTION:with Bhante Buddharakkhita\n\nThe Buddha’s teaching (*the Dh
 amma*) leads to peace/happiness\, knowledge\, high knowledge\, enlightenme
 nt\, and final awakening. What is the significance of joy in practicing th
 e Dhamma? Without experiencing joy\, the path to freedom might be tough. 
 However\, by experiencing joy\, we can be motivated to practice the Dhamma
 . In this daylong program\, we will explore the purpose of joy in practici
 ng the Dhamma. The day will include a Dhamma talk\, guided meditation\, a 
 question and answer session\, and discussion.
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/the-joy-of-dhamma-prac
 tice-bb1g26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wine Tails Trail at Cuvaison Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T170000
UID:260508KPy4BCje1EOvrB1uYP3HWQ
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy a new way to experience Cuvaison with your canine compan
 ion on the Wine Tails Trail. This self-guided vineyard walk winds just und
 er a mile through our Los Carneros estate\, with QR code stops highlightin
 g the history of our vines and winemaking. Guests begin their adventure by
  checking in with our Concierge for a map and orientation before setting o
 ff on the trail.\n\nAfter the walk\, return to the estate and enjoy a seat
 ed tasting of our current release wines\, while your pup relaxes by your s
 ide and enjoys a selection of “Barkuterie.” The Wine Tails Trail is a 
 chance to stretch your legs\, explore the vineyard\, and savor Cuvaison in
  the company of your best friend.\n\nWhen booking this experience\, please
  plan for the dog walk to begin at the time you select. The walk itself av
 erages about 45 minutes\, though you’ll also check in with our Concierge
  before and after\, as well as complete a quick waiver at the start. Your 
 wine tasting will be scheduled 60 minutes after your selected walk time\, 
 allowing a smooth transition from the trail back to your seated experience
 .\n\nGroup Size: Up to 4 guests\, including non-tasters\n\nDuration: Pleas
 e allow 120 minutes for this experience
LOCATION:Cuvaison Experience Salon\, Outdoors Only
URL:https://tewines.com/pages/cuvaison-tastings 
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sonoma Sundays on the Plaza - Alabama Mike
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T170000
UID:260502HsWX7k9L40i971PrHa3lyg
DESCRIPTION:This summer\, Music in Place and the City of Sonoma invite you
  to soak up the sunshine\, sip local wine\, and dance to live music at the
  Sonoma Plaza Grinstead Amphitheater during Sonoma Sundays On the Plaza\, 
 a free concert series running June 7 through October 4\, 2026.\n\nThis wee
 k's lineup features Alabama Mike! Born in Talladega\, Alabama Mike’s ear
 ly influences were ZZ Hill\, Johnnie ‘Soul” Taylor\, Lightning Hopkins
  and Junior Wells. He has won various awards and has been nominated by The
  Blues Foundation on several occasions. In addition\, he has played major 
 festivals\, both domestically and internationally and is presently been re
 ferred to by some as the Future Of The Blues! \n\nSonoma Sundays are free
  and open to all\, thanks to the generous support of the Sonoma Community 
 Center\, The Dawn Redwoods Trust\, and the McNeely Family Foundation.\n\nP
 ack your picnic\, bring your dancing shoes\, and meet us on the Plaza!
LOCATION:Grinstead Amphitheater
URL:https://musicinplace.org/event/sonoma-sundays-on-the-plaza-6-14/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
