BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Summer Staged Reading Series
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T183000
UID:260512QN_Q-1vS1EKC6P1QNfG_Ww
DESCRIPTION:This summer\, Valley Players invites you to six unforgettable 
 evenings of theatre — featuring staged readings of bold\, original works
  by both veteran playwrights and emerging talents. Be the first to experie
 nce these sparkling new works brought to life!\n\n**June 14:** *Mother\, I
  Could Kill You* by Barbara A. Silverstone\n\n**June 28:** A Night of One-
 Acts\n\n*When We Ceased to Be?* by Jack Bushnell\n\n*At Midspan on the And
 y Warhol* by Kirk Johnson\n\n**July 12:** *Waldorf School* by Nate Currier
 \n\n**July 26:** *Deadly Pursuits* by Lorraine Midanik\n\n**August 9:** A 
 Night of Shorts\n\n*Madam Director* by Gary A. Davis\n\n*Date Night* by Ba
 rbara A. Silverstone\n\n*Table in the Air* by Rex McGregor\n\n*An Empowere
 d Woman* by Barbara Anderson\n\n**August 23:** *Night Shift* by Mack Wrigh
 t\n\nEach play will be followed by a short talk-back.\n\nBuy tickets onlin
 e and save $3 off the at the door price! Tickets can be pre-purchased onli
 ne or by calling 707-948-6273 for $12 or purchased at the door beginning 3
 0 minutes before showtime for $15.
LOCATION:NVEF Discovery Campus
URL:https://www.valley-players.com/2026/03/06/valley-players-summer-2026-s
 taged-reading-series/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bricoleur Vineyards Essentials Picnic
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260628T153000
UID:260508xPtjEgqMPU2GGLxu02WmsQ
DESCRIPTION:Bricoleur Vineyards’ beloved Essentials Picnic pairs a b
 ottle of wine with charcuterie\, presented in a quintessential wicker bask
 et and a chic red wagon\, offering a relaxed and beautifully curated alfre
 sco wine country experience. Guests can enjoy their picnic in picturesque\
 , family- and dog-friendly settings across the estate—whether on the Pav
 ilion lawn\, beneath the trellis by the pond\, or at the picnic tables nes
 tled within the culinary and rose gardens. With exceptional wines\, thou
 ghtfully crafted foods\, and sweeping vistas\, a visit to Bricoleur Vin
 eyards offers a laid-back\, family-friendly atmosphere featuring lawn ga
 mes\, board games\, scavenger hunts\, and catch-and-release fishing.
LOCATION:Bricoleur Vineyard
URL:https://bricoleurvineyards.com/pages/visit?srsltid=AfmBOoq4MRc2MHal1tH
 0HwUmLbCHlVrPlsnizqNwrRFitw3UKui4rRJV
