 mmission establishes policy\; sets goals and objectives\; hires and evalua
 tes the director\; establishes and monitors the annual budget\; and exerci
 ses such other powers\, consistent with the law to foster the effective us
 e and management of the library. The commission generally meets monthly\, 
 with additional special meetings as needed. Meetings are open to the publi
