BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:SCREAM at FUN SIZE Blasted Art Gallery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260702T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260702T190000
UID:260612t0XEy0hPEkCGvjdLBIcI4Q
DESCRIPTION:Twelve Sonoma County artists will “SCREAM” together in a m
 iniature exhibit. The exhibit\, as well as every individual artwork in the
  show share the same title: SCREAM.\n\nThe miniature FUN SIZE Blasted Art 
 Gallery\, which measures 16 x 33 x 21”\, serves as a portable vessel for
  this chorus of artists\, was created as a timely response to global\, nat
 ional\, local\, and personal issues.\n\nThese artists will be SCREAMing to
 gether: Arminée Chahbazian\, Art Moura\, Bill Shelley\, Britta Kathmeyer\
 , Carlos Perez\, Chris Beards\, Jennifer Mygatt Tatum\, Kathleen Youngquis
 t\, Keviette Minor\, Kristen Throop\, Nick Mancillas\, and Nicole Mathers.
 \n\nThe Thursday\, July 2 Grand Opening at Rena Charles Gallery (439 Heald
 sburg Ave.\, Healdsburg) is from 5-7pm\, coinciding with Art Nite Healdsbu
 rg First Thursday.\n\nIf you miss Thursday's event\, the following night\,
  Friday\, July 3 Opening Reception is at the Santa Rosa Arts Center in the
  SOFA Arts District (312 South A Street\, Santa Rosa) at 5-8pm\, coincidin
 g with SOFA Arts District First Friday. \n\nBoth events are free.\n\nSCRE
 AM and FUN SIZE Blasted Art Gallery are a project of Blasted Art Gallery (
 Santa Rosa artists Chris Beards & Bill Shelley)\, which presented gallery 
 exhibits featuring Sonoma County artists from 2017 to 2019 in the SOFA Art
 s District in Santa Rosa\, and online in 2020.
LOCATION:Rena Charles Gallery
URL:https://bohemian.com/events-calendar/#/details/scream-at-fun-size-blas
 ted-art-gallery/19154704/2026-07-02T17
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
