BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Eleven Eleven: THE WE11NESS EXPERIENCE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260702T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260702T190000
UID:2605149gjPCMmwIUKgeE1ZlPpWVQ
DESCRIPTION:At Eleven Eleven\, wellness is more than a philosophy—it’s
  a way of life. An everyday practice rooted in being present\, savoring ea
 ch moment\, and embracing life’s simple pleasures.\n\nInspired by this b
 elief\, The We11ness Experience was created four years ago to encourage li
 ving fully and mindfully. Returning in 2026\, it invites you once again to
  engage your senses\, spark meaningful connections\, and celebrate the art
  of living well.\n\nOn the first Thursday of each month\, from April to Oc
 tober\, we’ll host guest speakers offering fresh perspectives on wellnes
 s—covering mindfulness\, emotional balance\, nutrition\, self-care\, and
  more. Each event is paired with thoughtfully curated bites and our signat
 ure Eleven Eleven wines\, all set amidst the serene beauty of our Napa Val
 ley winery.\n\nJoin us for this journey where wine and wellness come toget
 her\, creating unforgettable moments of presence\, connection\, and joy. H
 ere's to living well—uncorked and shared generously!\n\nMay: Intellectua
 l Wellness featuring Alison Levine\n\nJune: Emotional Wellness featuring M
 ayra Hernandez\n\nAugust: Occupational Wellness featuring Patrick Dossett\
 n\nSeptember: Physical Wellness featuring BodyRok & Jeannette of Poppywell
  and Swor-Yim Aesthetics\n\nOctober: Social Wellness featuring Meredith Si
 nclair\, M.Ed.\n\nFirst Thursday Of Each Month\n\nApril - June & August - 
 October 2026\n\n5:30 pm - 7:00 pm\n\nAll-Inclusive General Admission: $45 
 per person\n\nPlus\, your entry is on us when you purchase two or more bot
 tles during the event!
LOCATION:Eleven Eleven Wines
URL:https://www.elevenelevenwines.com/the-wellness-experience/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Taste of Italy at Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260702T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260702T170000
UID:260430ADjKQGlMv0ujOorHJdL9Bg
DESCRIPTION:For wine drinkers eager to experience world-class wines made i
 n California from Italian varieties\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
  is a must during any trip to Sonoma County. Located just off the plaza in
  the charming town of Healdsburg near famed restaurants\, boutiques and ga
 lleries\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room is a destination that invit
 es discovery. Founded by the acclaimed team that guides renowned Pinot Noi
 r and Chardonnay producer Rhys Vineyards\, Centennial Mountain was establi
 shed to explore Italian grape varieties grown on its acclaimed Centennial 
 Mountain Vineyard in the rugged mountains of Northern Sonoma County.\n\nTh
 e Centennial Mountain Vineyard Tasting features the winery’s coveted Neb
 biolo\, and the pioneering Carricante and Nerello Mascalese wines\, among 
 others. To showcase how beautifully the wines pair with food\, the winery 
 also offers a delicious Wine and Sushi Pairing from nearby Asahi Sushi\, o
 ne of Healdsburg’s most popular dining destinations.\n\nGuests can also 
 enhance their tasting experience with a curated salumi board from Journeym
 an Meat Company. This generous accompaniment features six house-made salum
 i\, crostini\, cornichons\, olives\, and a selection of local cheese that 
 serves 2 to 5 guests.
LOCATION:Centennial Mountain Tasting Room 
URL:https://cmvineyard.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
