BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:3rd of July Fireworks & Music Extravaganza
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T220000
UID:2606100eC80dkNhECJlSitFiMfxQ
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Independence Day the West County way at the 53rd Ann
 ual Sebastopol Kiwanis 3rd of July Fireworks & Music Extravaganza on Frida
 y\, July 3\, 2026. This beloved hometown tradition returns bigger and bett
 er at the Sebastopol Community Cultural Center — bringing together thous
 ands of locals and visitors for an unforgettable evening of music\, food\,
  fun\, and fireworks. The festivities kick off at 4:00 PM with live music 
 on three stages featuring Contigo\, The Musers\, The New Sky Band\, and a 
 DJ after-party. Stroll the grounds for delicious food trucks\, a full beer
  and wine garden\, and the popular Kid’s Corner with games\, a bounce ho
 use\, dunk tank\, and family-friendly activities. Kids of all ages will lo
 ve the festive atmosphere as the sun sets over the scenic West Sonoma Coun
 ty hills. Premium Seating is available inside the Community Cultural Cente
 r with special perks and parking. As darkness falls\, the sky lights up wi
 th a spectacular professional fireworks display launched at approximately 
 9:30 PM. This dazzling show has been a cherished Sonoma County tradition f
 or more than five decades\, presented by the Kiwanis Club of Sebastopol. A
 ll proceeds support the Kiwanis Club’s mission to fund local scholarship
 s\, youth programs\, and community service projects throughout Sebastopol 
 and beyond. Bring your blankets\, lawn chairs\, and the whole family for a
  safe\, festive\, and patriotic night that truly captures the spirit of co
 mmunity and celebration.
LOCATION:Sebastopol Community Cultural Center
URL:https://www.sebastopolkiwanisclub.org/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
